      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "thresholds": {"absolute_daily_paper_ic": 0.0070, "absolute_daily_paper_icir": 0.0840},
    "regime_notes": "Passed full-history gates narrowly. Positive in 2020-2025, negative in 2026-2027 and sharply negative in 2031 year-to-date; treat as regime-sensitive and monitor closely. The small 15-asset cross-section implies material IC uncertainty.",
